      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_error_logs.py` that queries recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service. For this task, I will use the Azure Monitor service, which is a concrete external provider for logging and monitoring. The code will include the Azure SDK import and the Azure Monitor-specific client class to make the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
